<title>USA: TABLE - Companhia de Saneamento sells 144a notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Companhia de Saneamento sells 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Companhia de Saneamento Basico do Estado de Sao Paulo was priced Wednesday via lead UBS Securities Inc, according to a market source.</p>
<p>The offering was increased to $275 million from an original size of $200 million, the source added.</p>
<p>BORROWER COMPANHIA DE SANEAMENTO BASICO DO ESTADO DE SAO PAULO</p>
<p>AMT $275 MLN	 COUPON 10.00 PCT  MATURITY 7/28/05</p>
<p>TYPE EURO NOTES    ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 1/28.1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S N/R   YIELD 10.00 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P N/R	 SPREAD 387.5 BPS  CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
